<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's singles order of play for</p>
<p>matches on the Centre Court at the Wimbledon tennis</p>
<p>championships, starting 1200GMT (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) v Michael Stich (Germany)</p>
